# Security Code Review

When the user asks for security review, OWASP audit, authz check, or "find vulnerabilities":

1. **MUST read and follow** `.cursor/skills/security-code-review/SKILL.md`.
2. Review only — do not modify application code to fix findings.
3. Focus on tenant isolation, authz, money voids, secrets, injection, CSRF.
4. Redact secrets in all output.
